{
  "key": 40580,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnIllProveItInABattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Me? I’m somewhere between fantastic\n",
        "and, uh, hopeless...\r",
        "But never mind that--my Pokémon are\n",
        "doing fantastic!\r",
        "In fact, I’ll prove that to you\n",
        "right now! Get ready, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnGiftForTraining",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Wow! Your Pokémon are also\n",
        "really impressive, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "But I bet they can get stronger!\r",
        "I’ve got a gift for you--one that’s\n",
        "perfect for training your Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnHaveThisTooThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Using that Vs. Seeker, you can\n",
        "find Trainers who want a rematch\f",
        "with you.\r",
        "Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, do you also have\n",
        "a Pokétch?\r",
        "Yup, you do.\n",
        "You can have this too, then.\r",
        "You deserve it for all your hard\n",
        "work, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_DawnUseDowsingMachineOften",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: The {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0} is\n",
        "something you should touch often.\r",
        "It will tell you if there is an item\n",
        "on the ground that you can’t see.\r",
        "I think there’s something here, even.\n",
        "You should try it out.\r",
        "OK, let’s keep working on our\n",
        "Pokédexes.\r",
        "Professor Rowan is counting on us!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasIllProveItInABattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "How’s your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Me? I’m always doing great!\n",
        "...I wish...\r",
        "But that’s not important.\r",
        "What is important is that my Pokémon\n",
        "are stronger than ever.\r",
        "I’ll prove it to you in a battle\n",
        "right now, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasGiftForTraining",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Heh. Your Pokémon are doing\n",
        "well too, yup.\r",
        "Still, there’s always going to be\n",
        "room for improvement.\r",
        "Here’s a gift that can help make\n",
        "your Pokémon even stronger.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasHaveThisTooThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Using that Vs. Seeker, you can\n",
        "find Trainers who want to battle with\f",
        "you again.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what about a Pokétch?\n",
        "Do you have one?\r",
        "Yup, you do.\n",
        "You can have this too, then.\r",
        "You deserve it for all of your\n",
        "effort, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_LucasTryTouchingDowsingMachine",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: The {STRVAR_1 24, 1, 0} is...\n",
        "Just try touching it.\r",
        "It’ll alert you if there is an\n",
        "unseeable item on the ground.\r",
        "Try it out now.\n",
        "I think there’s something here.\r",
        "OK, keep working on your Pokédex.\n",
        "Professor Rowan is counting on us!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_Dummy8",
      "garbage": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_ThatSlopesTooSlippery",
      "en_US": [
        "That slope’s too slippery.\n",
        "You’ll need a Bike to get up.\r",
        "You don’t have a Bicycle?\n",
        "There’s a Cycle Shop in Eterna City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_ChangeGearTakeARun",
      "en_US": [
        "Change to the 4th gear and take a run.\n",
        "That’ll shoot you right up that slope."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SignMtCoronet",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 207\n",
        "Mt. Coronet"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SignOreburghCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 207\n",
        "Oreburgh City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_TrainerTipsImmobilizedIfAsleepOrParalyzed",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "Pokémon may become immobilized if\n",
        "they are asleep or paralyzed.\r",
        "If it happens to your Pokémon,\n",
        "it could be disastrous.\r",
        "If your opponent’s Pokémon can’t\n",
        "move, it’s a big opportunity!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Rock-type Master!\n",
        "I aim to find the ultimate Rock-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be a {COLOR 1}Rock-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Rock-type looks pretty strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Rock-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for a Rock-type battle!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Rock-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "The ultimate Rock-type Pokémon\n",
        "belongs to me!\r",
        "But I’m always ready for another\n",
        "Rock-type battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Rock-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route207_Text_SovereignRockMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
